{"file": "重生螳螂，觉醒无限吞噬进化-第2集.mp4", "ep": 2, "duration": 167.6, "segments": [{"start": 18.64, "end": 19.84, "text": "你躲得还挺快"}, {"start": 20.24, "end": 21.72, "text": "这次算你们运气好"}, {"start": 31.19, "end": 31.63, "text": "别急"}, {"start": 31.83, "end": 32.43, "text": "再等等"}, {"start": 32.75, "end": 33.55, "text": "不是走了吗"}, {"start": 33.75, "end": 34.35, "text": "等什么"}, {"start": 34.95, "end": 36.31, "text": "万一她是假装非贼"}, {"start": 36.63, "end": 37.83, "text": "咱俩出去不就是白送"}, {"start": 38.35, "end": 38.99, "text": "有道理"}, {"start": 39.27, "end": 39.87, "text": "时克郎"}, {"start": 39.99, "end": 40.91, "text": "你太聪明了"}, {"start": 41.39, "end": 42.67, "text": "刚才被鸟追得太急"}, {"start": 42.83, "end": 43.79, "text": "我一下没想起来"}, {"start": 43.95, "end": 44.71, "text": "你叫什么来着"}, {"start": 45.11, "end": 46.15, "text": "我是邓大郎啊"}, {"start": 48.34, "end": 49.58, "text": "这些什么名啊"}, {"start": 81.0, "end": 82.6, "text": "真是美妙的一晚啊"}, {"start": 82.8, "end": 83.4, "text": "舒服"}, {"start": 84.41, "end": 85.09, "text": "小的们"}, {"start": 85.25, "end": 85.93, "text": "天亮了"}, {"start": 86.09, "end": 86.93, "text": "起来干饭"}, {"start": 87.13, "end": 87.53, "text": "好"}, {"start": 91.07, "end": 91.67, "text": "小的们"}, {"start": 95.91, "end": 96.51, "text": "爱飞"}, {"start": 97.56, "end": 97.96, "text": "谁"}, {"start": 98.2, "end": 99.96, "text": "爱飞"}, {"start": 105.84, "end": 106.44, "text": "邓大唐"}, {"start": 106.6, "end": 107.04, "text": "出来"}, {"start": 107.94, "end": 109.1, "text": "昨天吃了个饱"}, {"start": 109.18, "end": 110.34, "text": "今日本想多睡会"}, {"start": 110.42, "end": 111.02, "text": "叫什么叫"}, {"start": 111.1, "end": 111.58, "text": "当心我"}, {"start": 115.56, "end": 116.8, "text": "你是时克郎"}, {"start": 122.36, "end": 122.84, "text": "怎么样"}, {"start": 123.12, "end": 128.08, "text": "凌主大人见了"}, {"start": 128.2, "end": 129.52, "text": "四条腿都得夹紧了"}, {"start": 129.84, "end": 130.44, "text": "你怎么做到"}, {"start": 130.44, "end": 131.6, "text": "这么高大威猛的"}, {"start": 132.0, "end": 132.76, "text": "吃得多"}, {"start": 133.08, "end": 134.04, "text": "自然长得快"}, {"start": 134.6, "end": 135.32, "text": "有道理"}, {"start": 135.76, "end": 136.4, "text": "你是什么"}, {"start": 137.55, "end": 138.11, "text": "就这个"}, {"start": 138.71, "end": 139.71, "text": "昨晚端了两窝"}, {"start": 139.91, "end": 141.35, "text": "剩下这只给你当早餐"}, {"start": 142.27, "end": 143.03, "text": "青虫"}, {"start": 143.47, "end": 144.61, "text": "端了两窝"}, {"start": 144.81, "end": 145.29, "text": "是啊"}, {"start": 145.65, "end": 146.33, "text": "很轻松"}, {"start": 146.93, "end": 147.81, "text": "这下麻烦了"}, {"start": 148.13, "end": 149.69, "text": "青虫凌主抱负心很强"}, {"start": 149.85, "end": 151.16, "text": "他可不会放过咱们的"}, {"start": 152.94, "end": 153.66, "text": "慌什么"}, {"start": 154.1, "end": 156.22, "text": "青虫对我而言就是自助餐"}, {"start": 156.46, "end": 157.7, "text": "来多少都没用"}, {"start": 164.34, "end": 165.34, "text": "果然是他们"}, {"start": 165.74, "end": 167.54, "text": "就是他们杀了我们的兄弟姐妹"}]}